dates rust_time_function v1
description "A date with a time, whose alias ends with an underscore. The function of its time is cutoff__at, with two underscores in a row, which rustc's lint non_snake_case warns of, so the Rust code and the Wasm module do not build with -D warnings (W001). Every other target takes it as it is"
use calendar "../fixtures/calendars/weekends.cal"

inputs
  ordered : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31

date cutoff_ = ordered
  roll following
  at 17:00
